      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U05_L02_Q17</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.QE.3</p><p>If f(x)=(x+4)(x+9), what are the zeros?</p>]]></text>
