    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U05_L02_Q25</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.FND.8</p><p>Why is checking a factorization by multiplication useful?</p>]]></text>
